{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019110731551-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019122834\"/><p>事主由直升機送往灣仔直升機坪。</p><p>適逢重陽節假期，不少市民登高遠足。今晨(19日)10時29分，烈陽高照，一名老婦偕友前往西貢破邊洲行山，步至近東壩時，突感頭暈乏力，懷疑中暑，在場人員見狀遂代為報案。事主其後由奉召到場政府飛行服務隊，以直升機送往灣仔，交由救護車送往灣仔律敦治醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:39:25.342556+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:07:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T05:57:54.179029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:19.312128+00:00","content_hash":"f791e20a466689c0f16de3850c6188e60e4f5f7b73d03045d72e5fcd4e37b8b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}